# Each damage instruction hits all current opponents together (CR 120.2); prevention can save one without changing the others.
# Two ETB discarding players give two pings each. A 3-point Salve stops Bot2's two; lifelink gains Bot1 only Bot3's two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Tinybones, Pocket Nuisance
Scales of Shale
Swamp x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Healing Salve
Island x30

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest x35

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Tinybones, Pocket Nuisance.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Island)
Bot3.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Triggers(Tinybones, Pocket Nuisance; Tinybones, Pocket Nuisance)
